ted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Panchenko, Constantin A. “The Grecophone Byzantine Culture among the Melkites of the Late Middle Ages.” <title level="m">Филаретовский Альманах</title> 20 (2024): 71–88.
